# Shell scripts are bind-mounted into Linux containers and run with sh, so they
# must keep LF endings whatever core.autocrlf is set to on the machine that cloned
# the repository. With CRLF the first line already fails:
#
#   /init-app-db.sh: set: line 1: illegal option -
#
# which is how db/postgres-ha/init-app-db.sh and db/mongo-rs/*.sh break on a
# Windows checkout, although they are stored here with LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
